{"id":"wb-5-206","name":"清净化城塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西黃寺","text":"西黄寺是位于北京市朝阳区安贞街道黄寺大街的一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院，寺中的清净化城塔是北京现存四大金刚宝座式塔之一（其他三座分别为碧云寺塔、真觉寺塔、玉泉山妙高塔）。\n如今的西黄寺只是原来西黄寺建筑群中的清净化城塔院，塔院的山门开在黄寺大街11号。现为中国藏语系高级佛学院所在地，现任班禅喇嘛常居地，由中共中央统战部管理；同时作为西黄寺博物馆对公众开放。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E9%BB%83%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93284327,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93284327","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bfffe70ea5b33de236ac25f1.jpg","title":"Qing_Jing_Hua_Cheng_Ta,_Xihuang_Temple,_Beijing_Oct_2023.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qing_Jing_Hua_Cheng_Ta,_Xihuang_Temple,_Beijing_Oct_2023.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Qing_Jing_Hua_Cheng_Ta%2C_Xihuang_Temple%2C_Beijing_Oct_2023.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HMGiovanniV","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​西黄寺清净化城塔","width":320,"height":180}}